WEBVTT

00:00.567 --> 00:09.424
kanashige ni saku hana ni kimi no omokage wo mita

00:00.567 --> 00:09.424
I saw your image in the flower that is blossoming sorrowfully

00:09.937 --> 00:18.509
daisuki na ame nanoni naze ka kyou wa tsumetakute

00:09.937 --> 00:18.509
I love rain, yet it felt frosty today

00:18.651 --> 00:37.226
kisetsu wa meguri mori wa somerare kaze wa kanadete omoi afurete

00:18.651 --> 00:37.226
The season changed, the forest was colored, the wind played a tune, memories overflowed

00:37.600 --> 00:46.786
tsuki no kakera wo atsumete yume wo kazari nemuru

00:37.600 --> 00:46.787
Gather the pieces of the moon, decorate the dream and sleep

00:47.020 --> 00:56.153
toki no suna chiribametemo ano koro e kaeranai

00:47.020 --> 00:56.154
Even if I sprinkle the sand of time, I cannot return to the past

00:56.313 --> 01:05.420
ikiru imi sageshiteiru dare mo mina tabibito

00:56.313 --> 01:05.420
Those searching for the meaning of life are all travellers

01:05.769 --> 01:14.817
haruka naru tabiji tadori boku wa ima arukidasu

01:05.776 --> 01:14.817
I set my course on this endless journey

01:14.837 --> 01:22.812
ibara no michi no mukou e...

01:14.837 --> 01:22.812
for the place beyond the thorny path...

01:25.839 --> 01:30.759
The artist of life who produces miracles
with his godlike scalpel skills.

01:31.678 --> 01:34.013
The surgeon whom the era has yearned for.

01:34.889 --> 01:35.932
Black Jack.

02:07.858 --> 02:10.193
I'm done cleaning.

02:10.611 --> 02:11.611
That's right!

02:11.779 --> 02:14.697
Largo! Thanks! You can come in!

02:16.534 --> 02:17.617
What's this?

02:17.618 --> 02:18.368
Oh!

02:18.369 --> 02:20.203
Migewdness!

02:20.204 --> 02:22.767
This is Doc's wallet.

02:26.802 --> 02:31.111
Jeez, Doc, this is what happens
when you go out without me...

02:31.965 --> 02:35.385
He'll be having a hard time at Tom about now.

02:48.626 --> 02:51.694
Originally by Tezuka Osamu "Tetsu of the Yamanote Line"

02:48.626 --> 02:51.694
Tetsu of the Yamanote Line

03:14.091 --> 03:15.424
I'm home.

03:27.922 --> 03:29.244
You scared me.

03:30.388 --> 03:31.508
I'm home, sir.

03:31.846 --> 03:33.248
What's wrong?

03:35.362 --> 03:37.405
Welcome home, Kumiko-chan.

03:38.657 --> 03:39.699
Nothing.

03:39.792 --> 03:41.701
It was nothing.

03:42.369 --> 03:43.244
It was just a dream.

03:43.245 --> 03:46.372
I had a weird dream, that's all.

03:47.708 --> 03:49.624
Please take care of yourself.

03:49.805 --> 03:51.836
I'll quickly go change.

03:58.002 --> 03:59.568
I'm home, Dad.

04:15.068 --> 04:17.570
Thank you for everything.

04:17.571 --> 04:19.405
Why are you telling me this now, all of a sudden?

04:19.865 --> 04:24.706
Not only do you let me live here,
but you are always so nice to me.

04:25.579 --> 04:27.079
Think nothing of it.

04:27.080 --> 04:30.124
I'm just returning the favor I received from Dr. Honma.

04:30.709 --> 04:31.658
But...

04:32.419 --> 04:36.005
What was the weird dream you had earlier about?

04:36.506 --> 04:38.591
Well, it,was...

04:39.217 --> 04:41.052
It's a little old story about me.

04:41.053 --> 04:43.679
A secret of mine.

04:44.139 --> 04:46.223
I want to heard all about your secret!

04:46.264 --> 04:49.644
Oh, please spare me.

04:59.237 --> 05:01.322
He's finally here.

05:07.579 --> 05:09.246
Welcome.

05:09.271 --> 05:10.536
Welcome, Doctor.

05:12.250 --> 05:14.126
Are you alone today?

05:15.128 --> 05:15.961
Yes.

05:16.380 --> 05:19.455
She's keeping herself busy with laundry
and other household chores.

05:20.092 --> 05:20.834
sHere you go.

05:21.051 --> 05:23.286
It's been raining a lot lately.

05:23.553 --> 05:24.678
Welcome.

05:28.982 --> 05:30.268
Tetsu?!

05:34.064 --> 05:36.107
Please come this way.

05:36.108 --> 05:37.400
I'm fine right here.

05:37.984 --> 05:39.331
Sorry, sis.

05:39.611 --> 05:41.112
Sis?

05:41.113 --> 05:43.364
I can't stay long.

05:43.365 --> 05:45.157
I'll be gone after one cup.

05:45.158 --> 05:49.495
Oh, Kumiko-chan, I'm out of sandwich bread,

05:49.496 --> 05:51.872
so would you run to the store by the station and get some?

05:52.321 --> 05:53.027
Okay.

05:54.126 --> 05:56.544
Sir, would you like the house blend?

05:56.545 --> 05:57.253
Yes.

06:03.885 --> 06:06.679
It's a nice store, Tetsu.

06:06.680 --> 06:07.839
I think it's great.

06:08.390 --> 06:10.975
I'm working strictly honestly now.

06:11.101 --> 06:12.435
Are you sure?

06:12.561 --> 06:14.787
Sir, please don't worry.

06:14.788 --> 06:17.222
I'm completely clean.

06:17.399 --> 06:18.941
I hope so.

06:18.942 --> 06:21.277
It is said, "As a boy, so the man,” you know.

06:21.278 --> 06:22.194
Oh well.

06:22.195 --> 06:24.405
I didn't come here to see you today.

06:25.073 --> 06:27.199
Hey, Dr. Black Jack.

06:27.200 --> 06:29.822
I hear that you're still robbing like crazy.

06:30.537 --> 06:32.830
I'm only take appropriate rewards.

06:33.165 --> 06:40.692
But according to this country's law, you are not supposed
to perform any surgery without the proper license.

06:41.381 --> 06:45.593
Are you telling me that the law will cure every patient?

06:45.677 --> 06:46.677
What?!

06:48.513 --> 06:52.141
Anyway, please come with me to my office.

06:52.475 --> 06:54.310
If you're asking me to come voluntary, then I decline.

06:54.477 --> 06:56.687
I have a warrant.

07:00.358 --> 07:03.235
Have a drink, sir.

07:04.279 --> 07:08.574
My fingers were restored to normal
because of you and him.

07:08.742 --> 07:12.494
I can't remember such an old story.

07:15.874 --> 07:19.595
Oh, sir, this is a pretty nice hat.

07:20.587 --> 07:23.672
It's only the kind of crap that a low-income cop can afford.

07:23.840 --> 07:29.887
But Doc, you, and I have such a strange past, don't we?

07:32.390 --> 07:35.434
I just remembered that old story.

07:36.978 --> 07:39.939
Has it been ten years already?

07:39.940 --> 07:45.277
I envied the entertainment world,
especially since I was a magician.

08:00.842 --> 08:02.093
Look what happened!

08:11.137 --> 08:16.975
Te-cchan, you really need to be more flashy
on stage, like pull off an illusion!

08:17.310 --> 08:19.019
Here is your pay for your shows up until today.

08:19.020 --> 08:21.105
You don't have to come in again.

08:21.106 --> 08:22.606
Sorry, Te-cchan.

08:30.949 --> 08:31.782
Damn you!

08:32.033 --> 08:33.409
The hell with illusion!

08:33.410 --> 08:35.325
Magic is art!

08:48.216 --> 08:49.909
<i>A pickpocket!</i>

09:05.650 --> 09:09.486
His sleight of hand was just like performing magic.

09:09.654 --> 09:13.532
I practiced hard, day after day!

09:15.368 --> 09:17.494
Yes, this is the feeling!

09:17.631 --> 09:20.153
Te-cchan, this is really your last chance.

09:20.290 --> 09:21.623
Do it right.

09:21.624 --> 09:23.959
It'll be okay. Leave it to me.

09:24.627 --> 09:26.405
Ladies and gentlemen!

10:03.458 --> 10:06.210
It's a type of mental illness called social anxiety disorder.

10:06.506 --> 10:12.216
Excessive stress and anxiety is
suppressing a chemical called serotonin,

10:12.217 --> 10:13.967
thus causing this disorder.

10:14.344 --> 10:18.555
Sweating, shivering, and dizziness are
all some of the symptoms of it.

10:20.391 --> 10:23.276
What will I do?

10:23.811 --> 10:26.730
We'll give you some counseling and medicine.

10:27.406 --> 10:28.815
And you should take some time off work.

10:29.317 --> 10:30.943
Let's take our time.

10:31.319 --> 10:33.779
But doctor, I must get on stage!

10:34.572 --> 10:36.382
You will not be able to get on stage for a while.

10:36.616 --> 10:40.827
Excessive stress is the cause of your disorder.

10:40.828 --> 10:44.665
In other words, being on stage is the root of your disorder.

10:50.338 --> 10:51.922
What should I do?

10:51.923 --> 10:53.340
What now?

10:54.926 --> 10:57.135
Damn!

11:10.149 --> 11:11.400
Wow!

11:23.287 --> 11:25.622
Damn it! I've done it!

11:35.842 --> 11:41.680
The anger from not being able to get on
stage and the poverty was affecting me.

11:41.681 --> 11:44.441
I couldn't stop pickpocketing.

11:47.390 --> 11:49.140
Takadanobaba.

11:49.225 --> 11:51.101
Takadanobaba.

12:07.743 --> 12:09.494
Shinjuku.

12:12.415 --> 12:16.751
One, two, three, four, five, six, seven...

12:17.211 --> 12:19.045
This was great.

12:20.589 --> 12:22.590
The train is about to leave.

12:22.591 --> 12:23.842
Please be careful...

12:37.922 --> 12:41.759
Back then, I was on train duty everyday,

12:41.760 --> 12:46.388
so I could catch a pickpocket called Tetsu
of the Yamanote Line red-handed.

12:46.556 --> 12:48.015
And then I got it.

12:48.016 --> 12:50.225
A guy who moves around in packed trains.

12:50.226 --> 12:52.853
I immediately knew that it must be him!

12:55.523 --> 12:59.651
Pickpockets set their target on rich-looking people,

12:59.652 --> 13:00.986
then wait for a chance whether that be

13:00.987 --> 13:02.112
using the support ring,

13:02.113 --> 13:03.489
putting a bag on the overhead rack,

13:03.490 --> 13:05.324
reading a newspaper,

13:05.325 --> 13:06.784
sneezing, yawning,

13:06.785 --> 13:08.118
or slumbering.

13:08.119 --> 13:09.995
He's looking for that moment.

13:09.996 --> 13:11.816
That very moment!

13:22.634 --> 13:25.542
You, don't move your hands!

13:25.715 --> 13:27.679
Come with me.

13:27.757 --> 13:30.640
Sign: Station Manager

13:27.931 --> 13:30.641
I haven't done anything!

13:31.100 --> 13:33.185
Where did you hide it?

13:34.187 --> 13:37.564
Like I said, you've got the wrong guy.

13:40.276 --> 13:41.568
Damn...

13:42.946 --> 13:44.029
Well,

13:44.405 --> 13:47.824
you don't have any evidence on me, so please excuse me.

13:48.243 --> 13:49.618
Bye.

13:52.573 --> 13:54.164
Tokyo.

13:54.207 --> 13:55.666
Tokyo.

13:55.667 --> 13:59.545
Please stand behind the white line.

14:12.684 --> 14:16.019
Damn!

14:18.982 --> 14:19.856
Damn!

14:23.069 --> 14:24.695
Ikebukuro.

14:31.035 --> 14:32.953
Tetsu!

14:34.247 --> 14:35.205
Pervert!

14:35.456 --> 14:36.708
No!

14:35.957 --> 14:37.040
Damn you!

14:37.041 --> 14:38.792
You damn cross-dresser!

14:38.793 --> 14:40.210
Take him to the police!

14:40.211 --> 14:42.504
No, there's a good reason for this!

14:42.588 --> 14:46.508
Everyone, he's a cop!

14:46.509 --> 14:49.803
Yes! I'm a cop!

14:54.976 --> 14:59.438
You've got it tough having to dress weird
like that so early in the morning.

14:59.439 --> 15:00.689
Shut up!

15:00.690 --> 15:02.524
It's your fault!

15:03.067 --> 15:06.695
What's wrong with me? I received help from a pickpocket?

15:34.015 --> 15:38.101
Dude, you've got some guts stealing from your own kind.

15:38.811 --> 15:41.938
Dude, come with us.

15:43.232 --> 15:44.483
Nippori.

15:44.734 --> 15:45.984
Wait!
Nippori.

15:48.918 --> 15:49.878
Tetsu!

15:52.283 --> 15:54.075
Wait, Tetsu!

16:07.715 --> 16:09.382
T-Tetsu!

16:10.927 --> 16:12.677
Tetsu!

16:17.058 --> 16:20.852
Doctor, can you reconnect his fingers
that were cut off by that glass sheet?

16:20.853 --> 16:25.148
I can't guarantee that they will be back
to normal even if we reconnect them.

16:34.075 --> 16:37.244
Doctor! Hold that operation for a while.

16:52.677 --> 16:54.599
Long time no see, Black Jack.

16:54.845 --> 16:56.781
I'm Tomobiki from the police deprartment.

16:57.056 --> 16:58.014
Tomobiki-san,

16:58.516 --> 17:01.601
are you here to threaten me so
I will operate on some outlaw,

17:01.602 --> 17:05.564
or will you arrest me for practicing without a license?

17:06.148 --> 17:07.791
Let me get straight to the point.

17:07.984 --> 17:09.848
The criminal is a pickpocket.

17:10.027 --> 17:13.591
He lost two of his fingers from an unfortunate accident.

17:13.823 --> 17:15.532
I need you to reconnect them.

17:15.783 --> 17:19.494
Most surgeons can do that.

17:19.495 --> 17:21.371
I don't want them just reconnected!

17:21.372 --> 17:23.790
I want them back to their original state,

17:23.791 --> 17:25.458
so he can use his fingers freely again!

17:27.587 --> 17:30.380
So he can work as a pickpocket again.

17:30.881 --> 17:31.715
Why?

17:32.341 --> 17:37.304
For a few months now, I have been tailing
him so I can catch him red-handed.

17:37.305 --> 17:39.764
But now this has happened!

17:39.974 --> 17:42.642
I won't let him retire now!

17:42.643 --> 17:44.811
I must arrest him!

17:44.812 --> 17:46.354
I must!

17:48.399 --> 17:51.276
No reward for the job again?

17:51.277 --> 17:52.610
Of course not.

17:52.611 --> 17:54.904
You should be grateful that l'm not arresting you.

17:55.156 --> 17:58.033
You'll do it, won't you, Dr. Black Jack?

18:00.971 --> 18:03.852
Sign: Police Hospital

18:04.165 --> 18:06.958
Please let him handle the operation.

18:07.335 --> 18:10.003
It has been approximately three and
a half hours since detachment.

18:10.004 --> 18:11.485
The necrosis doesn't look severe.

18:32.777 --> 18:33.488
So?

18:33.694 --> 18:35.085
Are they back to normal?

18:35.696 --> 18:37.655
The operation just finished.

18:37.656 --> 18:39.949
We'll have to see how rehab goes for next month.

18:46.499 --> 18:49.334
<i>It's been a long month.</i>

18:55.538 --> 18:58.648
Oh, are you two together?

18:59.470 --> 19:00.929
I was discharged today.

19:00.930 --> 19:04.266
Thank you so much, Doctor.

19:03.474 --> 19:06.267
Tetsu! Do the fingers move like before?

19:06.268 --> 19:09.145
Well, sure they do.

19:11.312 --> 19:13.973
Tetsu-san, please tie this.

19:16.737 --> 19:20.615
I can feed myself, and even play pachinko.

19:20.616 --> 19:22.200
Wow.

19:22.493 --> 19:24.045
See?

19:25.812 --> 19:27.092
Tetsu...

19:27.581 --> 19:29.999
You idiot!

19:30.000 --> 19:31.334
I don't care about those things!

19:31.335 --> 19:34.671
I'm asking if you can pickpocket like you did before!

19:34.914 --> 19:35.672
Pickpocket?

19:35.673 --> 19:36.798
With these fingers?

19:37.007 --> 19:39.259
Now you are asking for the impossible.

19:39.260 --> 19:41.553
Black Jack! You liar!

19:41.554 --> 19:44.597
I let you handle Tetsu, believing that you could cure him!

19:44.823 --> 19:46.933
Damn you, operating on him half-heartedly!

19:46.934 --> 19:48.642
You'd better be ready for this.

19:48.755 --> 19:50.395
I'll put you behind bars right now!

19:50.862 --> 19:52.585
I don't care.

19:52.773 --> 19:57.601
But the fact that the police let an unlicensed
doctor operate on him will be publicized.

19:57.778 --> 19:59.010
Are you okay with that?

20:04.451 --> 20:06.035
Damn!

20:06.036 --> 20:07.106
I'll get you back!

20:15.399 --> 20:19.362
Black Jack, it's been a while since then.

20:19.633 --> 20:23.553
But now I have enough evidence to put you away.

20:23.554 --> 20:26.931
So I came here to pick you up.

20:30.499 --> 20:31.980
Can I see the warrant?

20:33.099 --> 20:34.230
Fine.

20:34.231 --> 20:37.067
Open your eyes and read it carefully.

20:37.741 --> 20:38.985
Not here.

20:38.986 --> 20:39.439
Or here!

20:39.632 --> 20:40.153
Or here!

20:40.341 --> 20:40.879
Or here!

20:40.905 --> 20:41.486
Or here!

20:42.698 --> 20:46.367
Damn it, I'll be back!

20:46.368 --> 20:49.413
Be ready for me, Black Jack!

20:59.214 --> 21:01.341
Master, you did it, didn't you?

21:08.932 --> 21:10.183
You saved me.

21:10.184 --> 21:15.563
No, you are the one who chased him away that day
by saying that my fingers weren't back to normal,

21:15.564 --> 21:19.460
even when they completely were.

21:20.194 --> 21:24.364
I quit pickpocketing on that day
and decided to live honestly.

21:25.170 --> 21:26.004
Sir.

21:27.117 --> 21:28.534
You heard all that?

21:28.535 --> 21:31.120
My dream is a tainted one, as you just heard.

21:31.705 --> 21:35.961
Sir, would you make me that delicious sandwich again?

21:37.563 --> 21:39.134
Sure.

21:41.673 --> 21:42.989
Now, Master...

21:45.969 --> 21:46.761
It's not here!

21:46.762 --> 21:48.513
Doc!

21:48.514 --> 21:50.890
Doc, here you go!

21:53.102 --> 21:55.186
You are so hopeless!

21:55.187 --> 21:59.565
You can't do anything without me!

22:07.097 --> 22:19.052
I love you darling. If I can be united with you,

22:07.097 --> 22:19.052
daisukuyo anata to hitotsu ni nareru no nara

22:19.170 --> 22:24.169
I couldn't be happier...

22:19.170 --> 22:24.169
konna shiawase wa naiwa...

22:25.738 --> 22:31.207
I wanted to see you forever

22:25.738 --> 22:31.207
zutto aitakute mattetano

22:31.751 --> 22:37.209
I'm laying on the grill,

22:31.751 --> 22:37.209
ami no ue ni yasashiku nekasete

22:37.813 --> 22:40.298
being heated up by you,

22:37.813 --> 22:40.298
anata ni hoterasarete

22:40.507 --> 22:48.284
so much that I change color

22:40.507 --> 22:48.284
atashi wa iro ga kawarukurai

22:48.369 --> 23:00.138
I dress up with sparkly grains of decorations

22:48.369 --> 23:00.138
kirakira hikaru tsubu no kazari de oshare

23:00.346 --> 23:12.077
I love you darling. Please love me more and more...

23:00.346 --> 23:12.077
daisukiyo motto motto atashi wo aishite

23:12.317 --> 23:23.668
I love you darling. If I can be united with you,

23:12.317 --> 23:23.668
daisukiyo anata to hitotsu no nareru no nara

23:23.854 --> 23:28.775
I couldn't be happier

23:23.854 --> 23:28.775
konna shiawase wa naiwa...

23:29.003 --> 23:33.937
How does it taste?

23:29.003 --> 23:33.936
oaji wa ikaga?

23:45.057 --> 24:15.033
Ice Breaker

23:45.371 --> 23:48.123
That's it! It was a murder!

23:48.265 --> 23:49.817
He saw the killer...

23:49.864 --> 23:51.344
He's a murderer!

23:52.254 --> 23:53.218
My eye!

23:53.371 --> 23:54.051
Kumiko?

23:55.740 --> 23:57.684
Wait, who are you?

23:57.709 --> 23:59.142
Who was it?

23:59.229 --> 24:01.164
Who is that person...

24:01.324 --> 24:03.644
I keep seeing?

24:04.029 --> 24:05.029
That man...

24:05.215 --> 24:06.624
Watch out, Kumiko!

24:06.635 --> 24:08.315
The man she is seeing...

24:08.375 --> 24:10.909
You've been following me, haven't you?

24:11.782 --> 24:14.033
Next Karte - Ice Breaker

24:16.167 --> 24:17.766
Karte NG...

24:22.956 --> 24:24.589
Ohmegewdness!
